This directory contains the results of Question Answering Engine that uses difflib for both SimpleQuestions datasets 
(including either all questions (answerable, not answerable over Wikidata) or only answerable over Wikidata questions)
and all the relation prediction methods (relation vocabulary) and entity span prediction methods (entity span encoded with 0 and 1 ignoring or not questions 
with no equality or similarity with the enitiy label that SPARQL queries give for each question, combination of Sentence Transformer and cosine similarity metric 
and jaccard similarity metric.
